## Probe/diagnostic droppings. These are byproducts of running wine, DXVK or a test binary from the repo
## root; a `git add -A` then sweeps them in. A 4 MB Microsoft d3dcompiler_47.dll once landed here under the
## name `-F:fil3585…`, because `wine expand` treated its unsupported `-F:` flag as an output FILENAME.
